Title: Property mapping in querybuilder
Description: Does the querybuilder map the entity properties to their database column names when filtering?

```javascript
@Entity("users")
export class User {
    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()
    id:number;

    @Column("varchar",{
        name: "first_name"
    })
    firstName: string;

    @Column("varchar",{
        name: "last_name"
    })
    lastName: string;
}
```

Can i use ***firstName***  here or do i have to do use the actual column name that is in the database?

```javascript
const user = await getManager()
    .createQueryBuilder(User, "user")
    .where("user.firstName = :bind", { bind: "John" })
    .getOne();
```



